feat(c_api): Exported reverse_index_factory

Adds faiss_reverse_index_factory and faiss_reverse_index_binary_factory, which
write the factory description of an index as a NUL-terminated string into a
caller-supplied buffer.

Upstream: https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss/pull/5912 (merged)
Waiting for a faiss release that contains it; remove once the faiss submodule
is bumped to that release.

